      objectReference: {fileID: 838447027}
    - target: {fileID: 1313401169195097329, guid: 6d376265a39eb9645b74d5fe80d5146e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: storySegment
      value: "One day the rich man wished to send a magic ring to his daughter, so
        he called the dog and the cat to him. To the cat he said: \u201CYou are very
        cunning and prudent. You may carry this magic ring to my daughter, but be
        sure to take very great care of it.\u201D To the dog he said: \u201CYou are
        to go with the cat to take a magic ring to my daughter. Take care not to
        lose the way, and see that no one molests the cat.\u201D Both animals promised
        to do their best and set out immediately."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1313401169195097329, guid: 6d376265a39eb9645b74d5fe80d5146e, type: 3}
