    - target: {fileID: 1313401169195097329, guid: 6d376265a39eb9645b74d5fe80d5146e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: storySegment
      value: Once upon a time there lived in a certain pueblo a rich man who had
        a dog and a cat. His only daughter, of whom he was very fond, was studying
        in a convent in a city several miles distant and it was his custom, about
        once a week, to send the dog and cat to take her a little present. The dog
        was so old that he had lost all his teeth, and so was unable to fight, but
        the cat was strong and very cunning, and so one could help the other, since
        the dog knew better how to find the way.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1313401169195097329, guid: 6d376265a39eb9645b74d5fe80d5146e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: relicPopupPanel
