      objectReference: {fileID: 838447027}
    - target: {fileID: 1313401169195097329, guid: 6d376265a39eb9645b74d5fe80d5146e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: storySegment
      value: "Then they began to swim across the river, which was so strong that
        they were about= an hour in getting over, so that both became very tired
        and weak. Just before they came to the other side, the dog dropped the ring
        into the water, and it was impossible to find it. \u201CNow,\u201D said the
        cat, \u201Cwe had better go back home and tell our master that we have lost
        the ring.\u201D \u201CYes,\u201D answered the dog, \u201Cbut I am very much
        afraid.\u201D So they turned back toward home, but as they drew near the
        house his fear so overcame him that he ran away and was never seen again."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1313401169195097329, guid: 6d376265a39eb9645b74d5fe80d5146e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: relicPopupPanel
